# cabana_pergola -- ten bays of pergola along the front of Cabana Row. Placed in island.txt just
# outside the cabanas' porches; the row runs along world z, so every bay is turned a quarter turn
# and they tile at the 3.2 m post spacing the bay was drawn for.
